  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Settecamini. Identified in 1951, the site of Settecamini preserves in situ pavement of the ancient road as well as tombs and other buildings. A <em>statio\u00a0</em>or <em>taberna </em>is preserved at the site.</p>",
